<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Offline · AMT Logbook</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; display: grid; place-items: center; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; background: #f8fafc; color: #0f172a; text-align: center; padding: 1rem; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0; } }
    a.button { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1rem; padding: .6rem 1.2rem; border-radius: .5rem; background: #0369a1; color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div>
    <img src="/icon.svg" width="64" height="64" alt="">
    <h1>You're offline</h1>
    <p>Any timer you started is still running on the server.<br>Reconnect to see it or clock out.</p>
    <a class="button" href="/">Try again</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
